        heading: A note on these pages
        rule: false
        lede: ''
        paragraphs:
          - The Research Library is a summary of the books and studies behind Practice Labs. I’ve been reverse engineering and debugging love for as long as I can remember, and this is an index of much of what I’ve learned and who I learned it from.
          - Information wants to be free, and we want it to grow into knowledge and wisdom in our community. Most of it comes from people who spent their lives studying how we bond, change and heal. Every page links to the original books and studies, and the exercises stay as close to the original material as they can.
          - It’s taken years of reading, training with teachers, testing ideas in my own relationships and with the people I work with, checking each claim against the research. It keeps growing as I learn and my own skills are far from perfected. Everyone who participates will learn from each other. — JD
